@startuml state-booking
!include _style.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty description

[*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT : create booking
PENDING_PAYMENT --> PENDING_PAYMENT : payment declined
PENDING_PAYMENT --> BOOKED : payment approved\n[allocation fits]\n/ assign PNR, allocate berths
PENDING_PAYMENT --> FAILED : pay requested\n[allocation does not fit]
PENDING_PAYMENT --> EXPIRED : 15 minutes elapsed\n/ expiry job or next read

BOOKED --> CANCELLED : last active passenger cancelled\n(by user, chart preparation\nor train run cancellation)
BOOKED --> COMPLETED : journey completion job\n[run completed]

FAILED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
@enduml
